 "audio_url": null,
 "note_en": "闹笑话 (nào xiàohua) is a set phrase meaning \"to make a fool of yourself\" or \"to make an embarrassing mistake\": 有一次我就因为这种词闹了一个笑话 \"Once I made an embarrassing mistake because of a word like that.\" Note that 笑话 on its own is \"a joke,\" but 闹笑话 means you are the joke, not that you told one.",
